WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.970
I put five exchanges in one room to check something.

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.240
Each character is an exchange, live.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:11.520
The bubble over each head shows if the digital dollar is pricier or cheaper there.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.900
The classic idea is arbitrage.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.460
Buy where it is cheap, sell where it is expensive.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:21.110
But each side charges a fee, and almost nobody does that math on the spot.

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:25.310
Here the sign already shows the real number, fees included.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.660
Today, minus 0.20%.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.600
In other words, today it does not pay.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.020
And if one day the math works, the room tells you by itself.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.320
It is open source.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.410
It runs on your computer, no sign-up and no keys.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.600
Link below.
